  "releaseNotes": "ADR-backed architectural drift verification with deterministic .NET project-reference checks.\nStrict external fitness evidence provenance, explicit unknown semantics, stable fingerprints and reviewable baselines.\nOpt-in advisory or deterministic CI enforcement through the new drift command.\nPreserves existing commands, canonical defaults, JSON/SARIF, impact, review, Action and extension contracts.\nFull release notes: https://github.com/rodri-oliveira-dev/adr-guard/releases/tag/v1.6.0",
